  "text": "Skip to content\nFully insured shipping\nAuthenticity guaranteed\nWe buy it back\nNYC Diamond District counter\nSecure checkout\nPAMP 1 oz Pure Silver Card Shaped Coin – Royal Flush Queen of Spades 2026\nby\nPAMP\n✓ LBMA Good Delivery\n$\n249.99\nPriced live off the spot market.\nSee price history ↓\nMetal\nSilver\nWeight\n1 oz Troy Ounces\nPurity\n99.99\nType\nCoin\n7 In stock\nQty\nQuantity\nCheck/Wire\nCrypto\nCard/Paypal\n1-9\n1 - 9\n0%\n$\n249.99\n$\n254.99\n$\n262.49\n10-99\n10 - 99\n0.05%\n$\n249.87\n$\n254.86\n$\n262.36\n100+\n100 +\n1%\n$\n247.49\n$\n252.44\n$\n259.86\nAdd to wishlist\nGo to compare\nAdd to compare\nFully insured shipping\nShips in 1–3 business days\nWe buy it back —\nsell to us\nSecure checkout · NYC Diamond District counter\nSKU:\ns10queen\nCategories:\nSilver Coins\n,\n1 Oz Silver Bars\n,\nCollectibles\n,\nGifts\n,\nGovernment Minted Silver Coins\n,\nSilver\n,\nSilver Bars\nMint:\nPAMP\nPrice history\nPAMP 1 oz Pure Silver Card Shaped Coin - Royal Flush Queen of Spades 2026 was last recorded at $249.99 on September 30, 2026. Over the past 12 months it is up 56.3% and has ranged between $159.99 and $450.00.\nLast recorded\nLoading…\n1Y\n7D\n1M\n3M\n6M\n1Y\nAll\nDescription\nAdditional information\nDescription\n**New from PAMP Suisse. 2026 1 oz Pure Silver card shaped coin.**  ***The Royal Flush Queen Of Spades***\nEmbrace the thrill of the game with the 2026 $2 Royal Flush Queen of Spades 1oz Silver Proof Coin, a limited edition release struck by PAMP Suisse in 99.99 percent fine silver. Showcasing the iconic Queen of Spades in vivid color and proof quality, this Solomon Islands legal tender coin merges premium design with the timeless allure of poker.\nThe royal flush represents the best possible five-card hand you can make in poker. The royal flush must be a straight ten, Jack, Queen, King, Ace all in the same suit. This Queenof Spades is a strong symbol of the deck, captured here in a striking design embellished with a slick black finish! Limited mintage of 2,000 coins.\n1 oz silver coin features 9999 Fine Silver in the shape of a card\nLegal Tender of the Solomon Islands (2 Dollars)\nReverse has the Queen Of Spades in all its glory\nFront has an effigy of King Charles III with the weight, purity, 2 Dollars and the individual serial number\nComes in a display case depicting a pack of cards.\nFantastic gift for those poker players amongst us.\nAdditional information\nType of Bullion\nCoin\nProduct Type\nnumismatic_coin\nIssuer Country\nOther\nIs Legal Tender\nYes\nIs Monetized Bullion\nNo\nPurity %\n99.99\nMetal\nSilver\nWeight\n1 oz\nWeight Unit\nTroy Ounces\nRelated products\nExclusive!\nQty\nAdd to cart\nGifts\n,\nGovernment Mint Silver Coins\n,\nGovernment Minted Silver Coins\n,\nReligious Collection\n,\nSilver\n,\nSilver Coins\n2024 Australia 1 oz Silver Lunar Colorized Blue Dragon Capsulated\n$\n90.98\nQty\nAdd to cart\nQuickview\nGo to compare\nAdd to compare\nQty\nAdd to cart\n1 Oz Silver Bars\n,\nGifts\n,\nSilver\n,\nSilver Bars\nPAMP 1 oz Silver $2 Burton Morris – Popcorn Coin Pop!\n$\n130.93\nQty\nAdd to cart\nQuickview\nGo to compare\nAdd to compare\nQty\nAdd to cart\n1 Oz Silver Bars\n,\nGifts\n,\nSilver\n,\nSilver Bars\n,\nSilver Coins\nPAMP Suisse Burton Morris Gorilla Shaped 1 oz Colorized Silver Coin\n$\n130.98\nQty\nAdd to cart\nQuickview\nGo to compare\nAdd to compare\nOut of stock\nRead more\nGifts\n,\nGram Silver Bars\n,\nSilver\n,\nSilver Bars\n100 x 1 Gram Valcambi Silver CombiBar\n$\n405.88\nRead more\nQuickview\nGo to compare\nAdd to compare\n$\n249.99\nAdd to cart\nLogin/Register\nDon't have an account\nRegister\nCustomer Login\nIf you have an account, sign in with your email address.\nContinue with Google\nLoading\nYour Cart\nCart is Empty\nUpdating Cart!\nHowdy,                             Guest\nSign in\nDepartments\nShop\nMints\nCart\nMy Account",
